text: "## Summary\n<!-- Provide a concise description of the changes introduced by this pull request. -->\n\n## Motivation & Context\n<!-- Why is this change required? What issue or milestone does it address? -->\nCloses #\n\n## Invariant & Quality Checklist\n- [ ] **Single Git Branch Discipline**: Verified targeting `main` only.\n- [ ] **Author Identity**: Authored under `Krish Ujeniya <krishujeniya@users.noreply.github.com>`.\n- [ ] **Zero Local Heavy Builds**: All compilation, tests, and security scans run in GitHub Actions CI/CD.\n- [ ] **Python Tooling (uv Only)**: All Python operations strictly executed with `uv`.\n- [ ] **Mandatory Monorepo Layout**: No stray files in root; all files adhere to the mandatory structure.\n- [ ] **Tests & Verification**: Verified via fast local checks and passing GitHub Actions CI.\n- [ ] **Documentation**: Updated `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, or `docs/` where applicable.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix (non-breaking change fixing an issue)\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change adding functionality)\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that alters existing contracts)\n- [ ] Documentation update\n- [ ] Architecture / Refactoring\n\n## Verification Evidence\n<!-- Paste output of local loadless checks (e.g. make typecheck, make lint, git diff --check). -->\n"
